IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-part3-income-support`
IMPORT `uro-part3-housing-benefit`
IMPORT `uro-part4-jsa`
IMPORT `uro-part5-pension-credit`
IMPORT `uro-part6-esa`

-- Tests of the six non-dependant deduction provisions: arts 20(6), 23(3), 24(3), 26(7), 29(4) and 30(7).
-- The fifteen pairs below are read by hand from the text of art 20(6) (uksi-2026-148.txt, lines 196-214); the same
-- fifteen pairs are then required of each of the other five provisions, whose own lines are cited beside them
-- (art 23(3): 225-243; art 24(3): 272-290; art 26(7): 328-346; art 29(4): 364-382; art 30(7): 406-424).
-- The text prints the same fifteen "for X substitute Y" pairs in all six places (checked by script when the
-- encoding was generated); this file checks that the encoding says so too.

GIVEN old IS A NUMBER
      new IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`the pair of sums in the non-dependant deduction tests` old new MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF old, new

GIVEN s IS A `a sub-paragraph of a non-dependant deduction provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`all six provisions agree on the sub-paragraph` s MEANS
        (`art 20(6): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s) EQUALS (`art 23(3): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s)
    AND (`art 20(6): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s) EQUALS (`art 24(3): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s)
    AND (`art 20(6): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s) EQUALS (`art 26(7): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s)
    AND (`art 20(6): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s) EQUALS (`art 29(4): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s)
    AND (`art 20(6): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s) EQUALS (`art 30(7): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` s)

